<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <!-- Cookiebot cookie consent script: Banner script -->
    <script defer id="Cookiebot" src="https://consent.cookiebot.com/uc.js" data-cbid="7819dc9c-01f3-4d09-a8dc-b26fa39e69c0" data-blockingmode="auto" type="text/javascript"></script>

    <!-- META -->
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width">
    <meta name="author" content="WebPerformance Report">
    <meta name="description" content="Web performance report every week in your inbox. Reports. Decisions. Results.">
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
    <meta property="og:title" content="WebPerformance Report - Web performance report every week in your inbox">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Web performance report every week in your inbox. Reports. Decisions. Results.">
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://webperformancereport.com/assets/img/webperformance-report.png">
    <meta property="og:image:alt" content="WebPerformance Report">
    <meta property="og:locale" content="en_GB">
    <meta property="og:type" content="website">
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://webperformancereport.com/">

    <!-- TWITTER CARD -->
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="twitter:site" content="@webperfreport" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="WebPerformance Report" />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="Web performance report every week in your inbox. Reports. Decisions. Results." />
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://webperformancereport.com/assets/img/webperformance-report.png" />

    <!-- SPEED -->

    <!-- LINK -->
    <link rel="canonical" href="{{ site.url }}{{ page.url }}">
    <link rel="icon" href="{{ '/' | url }}favicon.ico">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="{{ '/' | url }}apple-touch-icon.png">

    <!-- PERFORMANCE -->
    <link rel="preload" as="image" href="/assets/img/webperformance-report-hero-image.png?20260927">

    <style>
    /* inter-regular - latin */
    @font-face {
      font-display: swap; /* Check https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/@font-face/font-display for other options. */
      font-family: 'Inter';
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 400;
      src: url('{{ "/" | url }}fonts/inter-v12-latin-regular.woff2') format('woff2'), /* Chrome 36+, Opera 23+, Firefox 39+ */
          url('{{ "/" | url }}fonts/inter-v12-latin-regular.woff') format('woff'); /* Chrome 5+, Firefox 3.6+, IE 9+, Safari 5.1+ */
    }

    /* inter-700 - latin */
    @font-face {
      font-display: swap; /* Check https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/@font-face/font-display for other options. */
      font-family: 'Inter';
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 700;
      src: url('{{ "/" | url }}fonts/inter-v12-latin-700.woff2') format('woff2'), /* Chrome 36+, Opera 23+, Firefox 39+ */
          url('{{ "/" | url }}fonts/inter-v12-latin-700.woff') format('woff'); /* Chrome 5+, Firefox 3.6+, IE 9+, Safari 5.1+ */
    }
    </style>

    <link rel="preload" as="style" href="{{ '/' | url }}style.css?20260927c">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ '/' | url }}style.css?20260927c">

    <!-- TITLE -->
    <title>{{ title }}</title>
  </head>
  <body class="{{ pageClass }}">
    {% include "layouts/shared/launch-bar.njk" %}
    <header role="banner" class="ui-section-header">
      <div class="ui-layout-container">
        <div class="ui-section-header__layout ui-layout-flex">
          <!-- LOGO -->
          <a href="{{ '/' | url }}" role="link" class="ui-section-header--logo">
            <img src="{{ '/' | url }}assets/img/webperformance-report-logo.png" width="100" height="100" alt="WebPerformance Report" class="">
          </a>
          <!-- HAMBURGER -->
          <input type="checkbox" id="ui-section-header--menu-id">
          <label for="ui-section-header--menu-id" class="ui-section-header--menu-icon"></label>
          <!-- MENU -->
          <nav role="navigation" class="ui-section-header--nav ui-layout-flex">
            <a href="{{ '/' | url }}#Subscribe" role="link" aria-label="Subscribe" class="ui-section-header--nav-link ui-section-header--nav-link-subscribe">Subscribe</a>
            <a href="{{ '/' | url }}#About" role="link" aria-label="About" class="ui-section-header--nav-link">About</a>
            <a href="{{ '/' | url }}#Catalog" role="link" aria-label="Catalog" class="ui-section-header--nav-link">Catalog</a>
            <a href="{{ '/' | url }}#Report" role="link" aria-label="Report" class="ui-section-header--nav-link">Report</a>
            <a href="{{ '/' | url }}plans/" role="link" aria-label="Plans" class="ui-section-header--nav-link ui-section-header--nav-link-featured ui-section-header--nav-link-first">Plans</a>
            <a href="{{ '/' | url }}#Contact" role="link" aria-label="Contact" class="ui-section-header--nav-link">Contact</a>
            <a href="{{ '/' | url }}#Subscribe" role="link" aria-label="Subscribe Free" class="ui-section-header--nav-cta">Subscribe Free</a>
            <a href="https://board.webperformancereport.com/" rel="noopener" target="_blank" role="link" aria-label="Your Board" class="ui-section-header--nav-board"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3h4a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v12a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-4"/><path d="M8 14l4-4-4-4"/><path d="M12 10H3"/></svg><span>Your Board</span></a>
                      <p class="ui-section-header--nav-note">Free plan: 4 reports a month, no card required.</p>
          </nav>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>
    <main role="main">
      <section class="ui-section-hero ui-section-hero--commercial">
        <div class="ui-layout-container">
          <div class="ui-section-hero__layout ui-layout-grid ui-layout-grid-2">
            <!-- COPYWRITING -->
            <div>
              <p class="ui-section-hero--eyebrow">Reports. Decisions. Results.</p>
              <h1><span style="font-size: 2.4rem; color: #fff;">WebPerformance</span> <span style="font-size: 3.10rem;">Report</span></h1>
              <p class="ui-text-intro ui-section-hero--lead">Web performance report every week in your inbox.</p>
              <p class="ui-text-intro">Nobody likes waiting for a page to load. Spot the speed and Core Web Vitals issues that hurt your user experience and can cost you conversions, see whether they are getting worse, and prioritize what to improve.</p>
              <!-- CTA -->
              <div class="ui-component-cta ui-layout-flex">
                <div class="ui-section-hero--actions">
                  <a href="{{ '/' | url }}#Subscribe" role="link" aria-label="Subscribe Free" class="ui-component-button ui-component-button-normal ui-component-button-primary">Subscribe Free</a>
                  <a href="{{ '/' | url }}plans/" role="link" aria-label="See Plans" class="ui-component-button ui-component-button-normal ui-component-button-ghost">See Plans</a>
                </div>
                <p class="ui-text-note ui-section-hero--trust">
                  <small>Free plan: 4 reports a month, AI Insight, no card required.</small>
                  <small><strong>Powered by <a href="https://www.webpagetest.org/?utm_source=webperfreport&utm_medium=website&utm_campaign=sponsors" rel="noopener" target="_blank">WebPageTest</a></strong></small>
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- IMAGE -->
            <img src="{{ '/' | url }}assets/img/webperformance-report-hero-image.png?20260927" width="512" height="478" fetchpriority="high" alt="WebPerformance Report Inbox" class="ui-image-half-right">
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="ui-section-sponsor-strip">
        <a name="Sponsors"></a>
        <div class="ui-layout-container">
          <div class="ui-section-sponsor-strip__layout">
            <p class="ui-section-sponsor-strip--label">Sponsored <span class="ui-section-sponsor-strip--label-soft">by</span></p>
            <a href="https://www.catchpoint.com/?utm_source=webperfreport&utm_medium=website&utm_campaign=sponsors" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img src="{{ '/' | url }}assets/img/sponsors/sponsor-logo-catchpoint-webpagetest.png" loading="lazy" alt="Catchpoint WebPageTest" width="200" height="71" class="ui-section-sponsor-strip--logo"></a>
            <span class="ui-section-sponsor-strip--divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <p class="ui-section-sponsor-strip--trust">Trusted by teams at Google, Airbnb, Stripe, IKEA, Nestlé and dozens more global brands.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="ui-section-title">
        <div class="ui-layout-container">
          <h2>{{ mainTitle }}</h2><a name="Subscribe"></a>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="ui-section-subscribe">
        <div class="ui-layout-container">
          {% block pagemaincontent %}
          {% endblock %}
        </div>
      </section>
      {% block shared_content_testimonials %}
      {% endblock %}
      <section class="ui-section-title">
        <div class="ui-layout-container">
          <h2>About Performance Report</h2><a name="About"></a>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="ui-section-about">
        <div class="ui-layout-container">
          <div class="ui-section-about__cards">
            <!-- THE PRODUCT: the same first paragraph on every report page -->
            <div class="ui-section-about__card ui-section-about__card--product">
              <h3 class="ui-section-about__title">About WebPerformance Report</h3>
              <p>WebPerformance Report is a reporting service. It gathers data from the tools you already trust and turns it into a clear report delivered to your inbox, on your schedule. Free to start, no dashboard to keep checking.</p>
              <p><strong>The WebPageTest Report</strong> shows, for each page, Core Web Vitals from the lab and from real users, optimization grades, Lighthouse scores and a content breakdown, plus an AI Insight that explains what changed since the last delivery.</p>
              <a href="https://webperformancereport.com/report/wpt/" rel="noopener" target="_blank" class="ui-component-button ui-component-button-normal ui-section-about__button">See the performance report</a>
            </div>
            <!-- THE SOURCE: the tool behind this page's report -->
            <div class="ui-section-about__card ui-section-about__card--source">
              <h3 class="ui-section-about__title">Where the data comes from</h3>
              <a href="https://www.catchpoint.com/webpagetest?utm_source=webperfreport&utm_medium=website&utm_campaign=about" rel="noopener" target="_blank" class="ui-section-about__logo"><img alt="Catchpoint WebPageTest" width="354" height="30" loading="lazy" src="{{ '/' | url }}assets/img/logo-catchpoint-webpagetest.png"></a>
              <p>Catchpoint ensures Internet Resilience for delivering superior customer and employee digital experiences. Its Internet Performance Monitoring gives deep visibility into every layer of the Internet, BGP, DNS, SASE, CDN and WAN, so issues surface before they reach your business.</p>
              <p>Trusted by Forbes&rsquo; top digital companies, global retailers and leading CDNs.</p>
              <a href="https://www.catchpoint.com/?utm_source=webperfreport&utm_medium=website&utm_campaign=about" rel="noopener" target="_blank" class="ui-component-button ui-component-button-normal ui-section-about__button">Explore Catchpoint</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      {% include "layouts/shared/users.njk" %}
      {% block shared_content_catalog %}
      {% endblock %}
      <section class="ui-section-title">
        <div class="ui-layout-container">
          <h2>Inside the Web Performance Report</h2><a name="Report"></a>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="ui-section-inside">
        <div class="ui-layout-container">
          <p class="ui-text-intro ui-section-inside__intro">When pages are slow, jump around or respond late, visitors notice: more of them leave, fewer convert and search rankings can slip, often before your team does. Every report shows where it happens across the six areas below, and what to fix first.</p>
          <!-- AI Insight leads: it is the differentiator, so it takes the most-seen spot -->
          <ul class="ui-section-inside__cards">
            <li class="ui-section-inside__card">
              <h3 class="ui-section-inside__title">AI Insight</h3>
              <p>What improved, what regressed and what to do next, in plain language you can forward to leadership.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="ui-section-inside__card">
              <h3 class="ui-section-inside__title">Core Web Vitals</h3>
              <p>How fast, stable and responsive your pages are, measured in the lab and for real Chrome users (CrUX). Google uses these metrics in search.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="ui-section-inside__card">
              <h3 class="ui-section-inside__title">Optimization scores</h3>
              <p>Grades for the basics, compression, caching, CDN and security headers, so you know what to fix first.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="ui-section-inside__card">
              <h3 class="ui-section-inside__title">Lighthouse scores</h3>
              <p>Performance, accessibility, best practices and SEO in one audit: the quality issues that travel with slow pages.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="ui-section-inside__card">
              <h3 class="ui-section-inside__title">Performance results</h3>
              <p>From first byte to fully loaded, with filmstrip and video, so you can see where the time goes.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="ui-section-inside__card">
              <h3 class="ui-section-inside__title">Content breakdown</h3>
              <p>What each page is made of, by type, so you can spot the images or scripts adding weight.</p>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://webperformancereport.com/report/wpt/" rel="noopener" target="_blank" class="ui-component-button ui-component-button-normal ui-component-button-primary ui-section-inside__button">See a full performance report</a>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="ui-section-title">
        <div class="ui-layout-container">
          <h2>Contact</h2><a name="Contact"></a>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="ui-section-close">
        <div class="ui-layout-container">
          <p>Get in touch: <a href="mailto: info@webperformancereport.com">info@webperformancereport.com</a></p>
		      <p><a href="https://www.producthunt.com/products/WebPerformance-Report" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="https://api.producthunt.com/widgets/embed-image/v1/review.svg?post_id=297274&theme=light" alt="WebPerformance Report - Web page performance test every week in your inbox.  | Product Hunt" style="width: 250px; height: 54px;" width="250" height="54"  /></a></p>
          <address>
            <strong>WebPerformance Report</strong><br>
            Reports. Decisions. Results.
            <br>
            <small>(stable version 😊)</small>
          </address>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    {% block shared_content_footer %}
    {% endblock %}
  </body>
</html>